# ---------------- About ----------------
option.ABOUT_PACK=§6§lCORAL VXGI
option.ABOUT_PACK.comment=Voxel based real time ray traced shader pack for Minecraft Java. Light is calculated by bouncing rays through a voxel copy of the world. Torches and lava cast colored, shadowed light while water and polished blocks get ray traced reflections
option.ABOUT_VERSION=Version: §f1.2
option.ABOUT_VERSION.comment=The change log is in DOKUMANTASYON.md
option.ABOUT_AUTHOR=Author: §eOktay Mercan
option.ABOUT_AUTHOR.comment=Creator and designer of the pack
option.ABOUT_CONTACT=Contact: §7-
option.ABOUT_CONTACT.comment=To fill this in, edit option.ABOUT_CONTACT in shaders/lang/tr_tr.lang and en_us.lang
option.ABOUT_WEBSITE=YouTube: §bwww.youtube.com/OKTAYMERCAN
option.ABOUT_WEBSITE.comment=www.youtube.com/OKTAYMERCAN . Minecraft shader settings cannot open links, so copy the address into your browser
option.ABOUT_LICENSE=License: §7All Rights Reserved
option.ABOUT_LICENSE.comment=Write the license of the pack here, for example All Rights Reserved or CC BY-NC 4.0
option.ABOUT_THANKS=Thanks
option.ABOUT_THANKS.comment=This pack was written together with §bClaude (Anthropic)§r, an AI assistant: the voxel ray tracer, the direct light sampling and the whole lighting pipeline were designed and coded with AI assistance. Thanks to the Iris and Sodium teams for the shader pipeline, and to the Minecraft shader community for the voxel ray tracing ideas
option.ABOUT_REQUIREMENTS=Requirements
option.ABOUT_REQUIREMENTS.comment=Iris 1.6 or newer with Sodium. A graphics card with OpenGL 4.3 support. OptiFine is not supported. macOS is not supported
option.ABOUT_PERFORMANCE=§a? Performance tips
option.ABOUT_PERFORMANCE.comment=Pick the Low profile first. Set Voxel Range to 128 on the Ray Tracing page. Lower GI Ray Steps. Set Shadow Resolution to 1024. Reduce your Minecraft render distance
option.ABOUT_DEBUG_HELP=§d? How to use debugging
