option.EMIT_CONCRETE_POWDER=Concrete Powder Glows
option.EMIT_CONCRETE_POWDER.comment=All 16 concrete powder colors become light sources. Good for testing how colored lights mix
option.EMIT_CONCRETE=Concrete Glows
option.EMIT_CONCRETE.comment=All 16 concrete colors become light sources. When off they behave as polished, slightly reflective blocks
option.EMIT_WOOL=Wool Glows
