option.SUN_DISC_BRIGHTNESS=Sun Disc Brightness
option.SUN_DISC_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Brightness of the sun disc. Higher gives a stronger bloom glow around it
option.SUNSET_STRENGTH=Sunset Colors
