option.STARS_BRIGHTNESS=Star Brightness
option.STARS_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Brightness of the vanilla stars
option.MOON_TEXTURE_BRIGHTNESS=Moon Brightness in Sky
option.MOON_TEXTURE_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Brightness of the moon texture in the sky. Moonlight itself is set on the Lighting page
option.CLOUDS=Clouds
