option.FOG=Distance Fog
option.FOG.comment=Atmospheric haze that makes far terrain fade into the sky color. Denser near sea level and in rain
option.FOG_DENSITY=Fog Density
option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=Thickness of the distance fog
option.BORDER_FOG=Border Fog
option.BORDER_FOG.comment=Fog at the edge of your render distance that hides loading chunks
option.BORDER_FOG_START=Border Fog Start
