option.RAIN_DARKNESS=Rain Darkness
option.RAIN_DARKNESS.comment=How much sunlight is blocked while it rains

# ---------------- Water ----------------
option.WATER_WAVES=Water Waves
option.WATER_WAVES.comment=Animated waves on water surfaces that bend reflections
option.WATER_WAVE_STRENGTH=Wave Height
option.WATER_WAVE_STRENGTH.comment=How strongly waves bend reflections
option.WATER_WAVE_SPEED=Wave Speed
option.WATER_WAVE_SPEED.comment=How fast waves move. 0 freezes them
option.WATER_WAVE_SCALE=Wave Size
option.WATER_WAVE_SCALE.comment=Size of the waves
option.WATER_REFRACTION=Water Refraction
option.WATER_REFRACTION.comment=Light bends when it enters water, so the bottom and anything under the surface appear shifted and wobble with the waves. This is what makes water read as water instead of glass
option.WATER_REFRACTION_STRENGTH=Refraction Strength
option.WATER_REFRACTION_STRENGTH.comment=How strongly the view through the water is distorted
option.WATER_CAUSTICS=Caustics
option.WATER_CAUSTICS.comment=Waves focus sunlight into moving bright patterns on surfaces under the water, and on everything around you while you are under water
option.CAUSTICS_STRENGTH=Caustics Strength
option.CAUSTICS_STRENGTH.comment=Brightness of the light patterns
option.CAUSTICS_SCALE=Caustics Size
option.CAUSTICS_SCALE.comment=Size of the light patterns
option.CAUSTICS_SPEED=Caustics Speed
option.CAUSTICS_SPEED.comment=How fast the light patterns move. 0 freezes them
option.UNDERWATER_BIOME_TINT=Biome Water Color
option.UNDERWATER_BIOME_TINT.comment=Underwater fog takes the water color of the biome you are in, so a swamp looks different from a warm ocean
option.WATER_ABSORPTION=Deep Water Darkening
option.WATER_ABSORPTION.comment=How quickly light is absorbed in deep water. Higher makes deep water darker and bluer
option.WATER_SCATTER=Water Color
option.WATER_SCATTER.comment=Strength of the blue green color that water adds by itself
option.WATER_SURFACE_OPACITY=Surface Opacity
option.WATER_SURFACE_OPACITY.comment=How much the water surface covers what is below it. 0 makes water crystal clear apart from depth darkening
option.UNDERWATER_FOG_DENSITY=Underwater Fog
option.UNDERWATER_FOG_DENSITY.comment=Visibility while your camera is under water. Higher means shorter view distance
option.WATER_SUN_SPECULAR=Sun Glints on Water
option.WATER_SUN_SPECULAR.comment=Bright reflection of the sun on water

