option.AUTO_EXPOSURE=Auto Exposure
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE.comment=Brightens the image in caves and at night, like eyes adapting to darkness
option.CAVE_EXPOSURE=Cave Brightening
option.CAVE_EXPOSURE.comment=How much brighter the image gets when you are underground
option.NIGHT_EXPOSURE=Night Brightening
option.NIGHT_EXPOSURE.comment=How much brighter the image gets outdoors at night
option.TONEMAP=Tonemap
option.TONEMAP.comment=How bright HDR light is squeezed into screen colors. §eACES§r: cinematic and contrasted, the default. §eReinhard§r: soft, keeps colors. §eHable§r: filmic look from Uncharted 2. §eNone§r: plain clipping, useful to check raw values
